================================================================================
CHALLENGE 5: THE SPEED RACE (CompletableFuture.anyOf)
================================================================================
SCENARIO: Your app needs a DNS resolution. You call two different DNS
providers simultaneously. You don't care which one is used; you just want
the result from the provider that responds the FASTEST.

1. TASK 1 (Server A):
   - supplyAsync returns "Response from Server A" (Thread.sleep 800ms)
2. TASK 2 (Server B):
   - supplyAsync returns "Response from Server B" (Thread.sleep 300ms)

3. THE RACE (anyOf):
   - Create 'CompletableFuture<Object> fastest = CompletableFuture.anyOf(task1, task2);'

4. THE FINISH (thenAccept):
   - Chain '.thenAccept(res -> System.out.println("WINNER: " + res));'

EXPECTATION: Even though both tasks are running, you should see
"WINNER: Response from Server B" because it finished 500ms earlier.
================================================================================